{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1403256-how-do-you-build-a-great-eclipse-2-5-edition","id":1403256,"title":"How do you build a great Eclipse? (2.5 Edition)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-17T11:25:04-07:00","id":1403256,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> How do you build a great Eclipse? (2.5 Edition)","content":"If you want to make an Eclipse that is very helpful to the Circle, what do you focus on?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-17T11:28:38-07:00","id":1403257,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1403256-how-do-you-build-a-great-eclipse-2-5-edition#post1403256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you want to make an Eclipse that is very helpful to the Circle, what do you focus on?</div> </div> </div> </div>What all splats are represented in the circle?<br /> <br /> \u200bWhat is the circle built to do already?<br /> <br /> What are the circle's short-term and long-term goals?<br /> <br /> Where is your game set?<br /> <br /> The answers to these questions will make quite a difference in the answers you will get to your question.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-18T01:22:22-07:00","id":1403352,"title":"","content":"The eclipse oath-sanctification ability typically lends itself very well to social charms. Helping the circle can be as simple as talking people into being nice to the cirlce, and then sanctifying that promise to make it stick<br /> <br /> of course, you can also be a dick about that - bind people to promises they will regret later<br /> <br /> <br /> similarly, eclipse has Ride and Sail charms for cheap. To help the circle, they're the transporation. Ride charms like Flashing Thunderbolt Steed will make a yeddim into a land-based rocket. Add Sometimes Horses Fly Approach once essence 4. Or something as simple as Master Horseman's Technique's master horseman's eye can judge how good a mount is at a glance.<br /> <br /> speaking of evaluating things: bureacracy charms means money. You can support the circle by keeping it well funded. Having loads of money to burn makes everything easier.<br /> <br /> <br /> So ya - social, business and transport. that's the usual things that an eclipse runs with, in my experience.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}